BT /F1 13 Tf 72 750 Td 15 TL (Lead 90th-percentile estimation from censored tap data - method) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 728 Td 12 TL
(This note specifies the estimation method for the 90th percentile of lead and copper tap) Tj T*
(concentrations when some results are censored \(detection limits\). The data for each system,) Tj T*
(monitoring period, and contaminant are the reported sample values with their qualifiers.) Tj T*
(Only the roster in systems.csv defines which system-period cells are reported; results rows) Tj T*
(for other periods never count.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Unit conversion is per row: a value reported in ug/L is divided by 1000 to give mg/L. Each) Tj T*
(row converts by its own unit; the file carries mixed units and no column-wide assumption is) Tj T*
(valid.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A result is censored when its qualifier is U or begins with <, or when its converted) Tj T*
(concentration is zero or below. Other qualifiers \(including J and B\) are detects and are) Tj T*
(used at face value. A blank value field is unparseable and the row is skipped.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Only LEAD and COPPER rows are used; rows for any other contaminant are ignored.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
