BT /F1 13 Tf 72 750 Td 15 TL (Sampling uncertainty - one-sided upper confidence limit) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 728 Td 12 TL
(The reported finding accounts for sampling uncertainty through a one-sided upper 95 percent) Tj T*
(confidence limit on the lognormal 90th percentile, by the delta method. Its standard error) Tj T*
(is se = sigma * sqrt\(1/n + z_0.90^2 / \(2*\(n-1\)\)\). The upper limit is UCL95 = exp\(mu + z_0.90) Tj T*
(* sigma + z_0.95 * se\), where z_0.95 is the 0.95 quantile of the standard normal. Report) Tj T*
(UCL95 in mg/L rounded half up to four decimals.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A cell exceeds the action level when its UCL95 is greater than the action level: 0.010 mg/L) Tj T*
(for lead, 1.3 mg/L for copper. The point estimate alone never decides the finding; a p90) Tj T*
(below the action level with a UCL95 above it is an exceedance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
