(A cell whose only usable rows are censored reports the minimum limit: p90 and UCL95 both) Tj T*
(equal the smallest censored concentration in mg/L.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A cell with exactly one detected value among any number of censored values reports the) Tj T*
(detected value for both p90 and UCL95. A cell with a single usable row \(n = 1\) reports that) Tj T*
(row's concentration for both. A cell with zero fitted variance reports UCL95 = p90.) Tj T*
